paste - join corresponding lines of text

SYNOPSIS
    paste [-d delimiter] [file ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Write a line from each input, separated by tabs or the given byte.
    A short input contributes empty fields after its last line.
    A single - may stand for standard input.

EXAMPLES
    paste -d : names numbers

SEE ALSO
    cut(1)
